# The Fresh Market weekly features. The tool does ONE fetch of this page and
# parses its embedded JSON (see src/meatshopper/sites.py). Best-effort and
# terms-gray: if the markup changes or the fetch is blocked, this store just
# reports no deals and you can paste a flyer here instead.
# This page is store-gated; the deals shown are for the store the page defaults
# to. It works from a home IP; a datacenter/CI IP may get blocked.
https://www.thefreshmarket.com/features/weekly-features
